ORDER (a) Applicant- Dinesh Narayan Rai in connection with C.R. No.I-196 of 2017, registered with Kasarvadavali Police Station, shall be released on bail, on his furnishing P.R. Bond of Rs.1,00,000/-
with one or more sureties in the like amount;
Darshan Patil 27.ba.2416-22.doc (b) The applicant shall not pressurize prosecution witnesses.

